  (text "CANary front panel (rack variant). J1 takes a 16-way ribbon from the main board's J501.\nLEDs: anode from FP_5V through R1-R4, cathode into the main board's open-drain sinks,\nso each lights exactly when its board LED does. 1k gives ~3 mA: dim on purpose, for\ndark venues. Lower R for brighter (20 mA max per sink).\nSW1 RESET is the short (7.3 mm) switch so it sits behind the panel: pin or paperclip.\nSW2 BOOT (9.5 mm) stands proud. Hold BOOT, tap RESET = ROM download mode.\nAt run time BOOT is free for firmware (GPIO0).\nJ2 (DNP): 3V3, GND, SDA, SCL, FN1, FN2 for a display or more buttons."
    (at 130 35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "504aabb8-bad5-4b34-9bb6-993c31637091")
